Falsifies `address_space_layout::verification::runtime_window_refuses_every_virtual_address_its_doc_forbids`.

The defect: `runtime_window` checks against a band with no upper end, so an address above `RUNTIME_WINDOWS` is accepted.

Expected to fail: the harness's `refused_inputs_never_reach_here` loop is reached, an unwinding failure, for an address above the band.

diff --git a/src/lib.rs b/src/lib.rs
--- a/src/lib.rs
+++ b/src/lib.rs
@@ -266,7 +266,7 @@
 /// **A runtime window's address, checked against the map at compile time.** As [`pair_page`], for
 /// [`RUNTIME_WINDOWS`].
 pub const fn runtime_window(virtual_address: u64) -> u64 {
-    window(RUNTIME_WINDOWS, virtual_address, PAGE_BYTES)
+    window(Band { start: RUNTIME_WINDOWS.start, end: u64::MAX }, virtual_address, PAGE_BYTES)
 }
 
